Package: com.zeshan.phoneaura
Name: PhoneAura
Version: 0.4.10
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64e
Description: PhoneAura is a free, modern redesign of the iOS 16 Phone app. Version 0.4.10 fixes Add Number with a native three-dot keypad menu for creating a new contact or adding the dialed number to an existing contact. It also includes live saved-contact suggestions, clipboard Paste, custom Favorites, smart Recents filters, call details, Contacts, swipe-to-delete controls, haptics and fluid animations. Built for RootHide.
Depiction: https://zeshan0727.github.io/depictions/phoneaura.html
Homepage: https://zeshan0727.github.io/
Maintainer: Next Solution
Author: Next Solution
Section: Tweaks
Depends: firmware (>= 16.0), mobilesubstrate, preferenceloader
